        "name": {
          "en-US": "shopservation"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Loud alarm for matching shopservatory finds"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Companion app for a self-hosted shopservatory instance.\n\nshopservation polls your shopservatory listing feed and sounds a loud alarm\nwhen a new find matches a rule you configure in the app. Rules match on title\nkeywords, exclusion keywords, a maximum price (per currency) and source.\n\nThe alarm plays on the alarm audio stream, so it is audible even when the\nphone is on silent or vibrate, and shows a full-screen stop screen over the\nlock screen.\n\nAll alarm logic lives in the app; the server needs no changes.\n"
        },
